<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH REPUBLIC AND NETHERLANDS LEVEL 2-2.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH REPUBLIC AND NETHERLANDS LEVEL 2-2.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Republic and Netherlands were level 2-2 after the singles matches in their Fed Cup semifinal on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) 7-6 6-3</p>
<p>Miriam Oremans (Netherlands) beat Adriana Gresi (Czech Republic) 1-6 6-2 9-7</p>
</text>
